   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Façade Drawings</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Building Façade Complexity and Gestalt Principles: Aesthetic Ratings\",\n  \"description\": \"Participants see 24 black-and-white drawings of a three-storey façade in random order. The drawings vary window shape (similarity principle) or window spacing (proximity principle) at three expert-rated complexity levels, four drawings per cell. Each drawing follows a fixation cross and is viewed freely; then it is rated on seven 7-point bipolar word pairs: simple–complex (manipulation check) and six aesthetic pairs (unpleasant–pleasant, distressing–relaxing, meaningless–meaningful, chaotic–coherent, commonplace–novel, unclear–clear). Rebuilt from Beder, Pelowski & Imamoğlu (2024), Journal of Eye Movement Research 17(2): 4, with the paper's Figures 1–2 drawings (CC BY 4.0). Scoring: aesthetic rating = mean of the six aesthetic pairs; 3 (complexity) × 2 (principle) repeated-measures ANOVA; check that simple–complex rises with the complexity level.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"facades\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part in this study.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"drawings\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"simple_complex\",\n      \"title\": \"Simple – Complex\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Simple\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Complex\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Perceived complexity: manipulation check, not part of the aesthetic score. Keyed by drawing: <principle>_<complexity>_<n>, principle = similarity (window shapes varied) or proximity (window spacing varied), complexity = low / medium / high (expert-rated), n = position 1–4 in the paper's Figure 1 or 2. 7-point bipolar scale, 1 = left word, 7 = right word.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"unpleasant_pleasant\",\n      \"title\": \"Unpleasant – Pleasant\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Unpleasant\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Pleasant\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Aesthetic rating item. Keyed by drawing: <principle>_<complexity>_<n>, principle = similarity (window shapes varied) or proximity (window spacing varied), complexity = low / medium / high (expert-rated), n = position 1–4 in the paper's Figure 1 or 2. 7-point bipolar scale, 1 = left word, 7 = right word.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"distressing_relaxing\",\n      \"title\": \"Distressing – Relaxing\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Distressing\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Relaxing\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Aesthetic rating item. Keyed by drawing: <principle>_<complexity>_<n>, principle = similarity (window shapes varied) or proximity (window spacing varied), complexity = low / medium / high (expert-rated), n = position 1–4 in the paper's Figure 1 or 2. 7-point bipolar scale, 1 = left word, 7 = right word.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"meaningless_meaningful\",\n      \"title\": \"Meaningless – Meaningful\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Meaningless\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Meaningful\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Aesthetic rating item. Keyed by drawing: <principle>_<complexity>_<n>, principle = similarity (window shapes varied) or proximity (window spacing varied), complexity = low / medium / high (expert-rated), n = position 1–4 in the paper's Figure 1 or 2. 7-point bipolar scale, 1 = left word, 7 = right word.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"chaotic_coherent\",\n      \"title\": \"Chaotic – Coherent\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Chaotic\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Coherent\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Aesthetic rating item. Keyed by drawing: <principle>_<complexity>_<n>, principle = similarity (window shapes varied) or proximity (window spacing varied), complexity = low / medium / high (expert-rated), n = position 1–4 in the paper's Figure 1 or 2. 7-point bipolar scale, 1 = left word, 7 = right word.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"commonplace_novel\",\n      \"title\": \"Commonplace – Novel\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Commonplace\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Novel\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Aesthetic rating item. Keyed by drawing: <principle>_<complexity>_<n>, principle = similarity (window shapes varied) or proximity (window spacing varied), complexity = low / medium / high (expert-rated), n = position 1–4 in the paper's Figure 1 or 2. 7-point bipolar scale, 1 = left word, 7 = right word.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"unclear_clear\",\n      \"title\": \"Unclear – Clear\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Unclear\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Clear\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Aesthetic rating item. Keyed by drawing: <principle>_<complexity>_<n>, principle = similarity (window shapes varied) or proximity (window spacing varied), complexity = low / medium / high (expert-rated), n = position 1–4 in the paper's Figure 1 or 2. 7-point bipolar scale, 1 = left word, 7 = right word.\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"Age\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"min\": 18,\n      \"max\": 110\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"architecture_training\",\n      \"title\": \"Have you studied or worked in architecture or design?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Not in the paper; added so results can be split by design training.\",\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"yes\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"no\",\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"facade-original\">{\"source\": \"Beder, Pelowski & Imamoğlu (2024) Journal of Eye Movement Research 17(2): 4\", \"n\": 79, \"participants\": \"Vienna residents aged 25–32 (49 women, 30 men), lab study at the University of Vienna with an EyeLink 1000 eye tracker; free viewing, answers given verbally\", \"result\": \"Aesthetic ratings fell as complexity rose (low M = 3.97, medium 3.89, high 3.64; F(2,156) = 37.98, ηp² = .33). Proximity-manipulated façades were rated higher than similarity-manipulated ones (3.91 vs 3.75; F(1,78) = 12.57, ηp² = .14). Highly complex façades drew more but shorter fixations and less total viewing time than medium ones.\"}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f3f4f6;--card:#fff;--ink:#1f2328;--muted:#5b616b;--accent:#3d5a80;--line:#dcdfe5;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#e5ecf5}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.view{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:5}\n.view{cursor:default}.view img{width:min(96vw,1000px);max-height:80vh;object-fit:contain;height:auto;display:block}.view .go{position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}\n.cross{font-size:48px;color:#333;font-weight:300}\n.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:4px}\n.row label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:.82rem}\n.row label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.row input{margin:0 0 2px}\n.sd{padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.sd:first-of-type{border-top:0}.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\n.f{margin-top:16px}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:110px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Drawings: Beder, Pelowski &amp; Imamoğlu (2024), Journal of Eye Movement Research 17(2): 4, Figures 1–2 (doi:10.16910/jemr.17.2.4, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='facade-drawings:state', T=window.__VIEWMS?{fix:window.__VIEWMS}:{fix:1500};\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, ids=[], st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function val(name){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+name+'\"]:checked');return x?x.value:null;}\n  var SD=[['simple_complex','Simple','Complex'],['unpleasant_pleasant','Unpleasant','Pleasant'],['distressing_relaxing','Distressing','Relaxing'],['meaningless_meaningful','Meaningless','Meaningful'],['chaotic_coherent','Chaotic','Coherent'],['commonplace_novel','Commonplace','Novel'],['unclear_clear','Unclear','Clear']];\n  function sdRow(p){var h='<div class=\"sd\"><div class=\"ends\"><span>'+p[1]+'</span><span>'+p[2]+'</span></div><div class=\"row\">';for(var i=1;i<=7;i++)h+='<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q_'+p[0]+'\" value=\"'+i+'\">'+i+'</label>';return h+'</div></div>';}\n  function radios(q){return '<div class=\"f\"><b>'+esc(Q[q].title)+'</b>'+(Q[q].choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+q+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Building façades</h1><p>You will see '+st.order.length+' black-and-white drawings of building façades, one at a time. Each starts with a small cross in the middle of the screen; look at the cross. Then look at the drawing for as long as you like and press <b>Done looking</b>. After each drawing, rate it on seven pairs of opposite words from 1 to 7. It takes about 15 minutes.</p><div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='trial';st.k=0;st.phase='view';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"f\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><b>'+esc(Q.age.title)+'</b><br><input type=\"number\" id=\"age\" min=\"18\" max=\"110\"></div>'+radios('gender')+radios('architecture_training')+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Finish</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var age=Number(document.getElementById('age').value),g=val('gender'),t=val('architecture_training');\n      if(!(age>=18&&age<=110))return err('Please enter your age.');if(!g||!t)return err('Please answer every question.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('age',age),SPSite.answer('gender',g),SPSite.answer('architecture_training',t)],this,function(){st.step='done';save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function trial(){\n    if(st.phase==='q')return rate();\n    var id=st.order[st.k],im=new Image();im.src=files[id].url;im.alt='Façade drawing';\n    var v=document.createElement('div');v.className='view';v.innerHTML='<div class=\"cross\">+</div>';app.innerHTML='';app.appendChild(v);\n    setTimeout(function(){v.innerHTML='';v.appendChild(im);var b=document.createElement('button');b.className='btn go';b.id='seen';b.textContent='Done looking';b.onclick=function(){st.phase='q';save();route();};v.appendChild(b);},T.fix);\n  }\n  function rate(){\n    var id=st.order[st.k];\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Drawing '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><div class=\"card\"><b>How would you describe the façade you just saw?</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\">'+SD.map(sdRow).join('')+'</div><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Next drawing</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var vals=SD.map(function(p){return val('q_'+p[0]);});if(vals.some(function(x){return x==null;}))return err('Please answer all seven word pairs.');\n      var sh=[files[id].name];\n      send(SD.map(function(p,i){return SPSite.answer(p[0],Number(vals[i]),{key:id,shown:sh});}),this,function(){st.k++;st.phase='view';if(st.k>=st.order.length)st.step='about';save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='trial')return trial();if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','age','gender','architecture_training'].concat(SD.map(function(p){return p[0];})).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('facades')||[]).forEach(function(f){if(/\\.(png|jpe?g|webp)$/i.test(f.name)){var k=f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'');files[k]=f;ids.push(k);}});\n    if(ids.length<2){app.innerHTML='<h1>Photos missing</h1><p>Upload the drawings to the media folder \"facades\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var valid=st&&st.order&&st.order.length===ids.length&&st.order.every(function(x){return files[x];});\n    if(!valid)st={step:'intro',order:shuffle(ids),k:0,phase:'view'};\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};if(a.consent!==true){st.step='intro';st.k=0;}\n    if(st.step==='trial'&&st.phase!=='q')st.phase='view';\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
